---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATA LICENCE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The datasets in `datasets/` and `backend/data/` are synthetic, generated by the
simulator in this repository. They contain no real patient data and no protected
health information. They are released under CC-BY-4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
`frontend/assets/vendor/chart.umd.js` is Chart.js 4.4.7, (c) 2014-2024 Chart.js
Contributors, released under the MIT License: https://www.chartjs.org/
It is vendored locally so the prototype has no runtime dependency on a CDN.

All Python dependencies are listed in `backend/requirements.txt` and are used
under their own open-source licences.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
MEDICAL DISCLAIMER
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software is a prototype for research and demonstration. It is not a medical
device, has not been clinically validated, and is not intended for diagnosis,
treatment or any medical decision-making. All performance figures are computed
on synthetic data. Nothing produced by this software replaces assessment by a
qualified clinician.
